					</view>
					<view class="demo-sect-stage">
						<view class="demo-sect-block">
							<vx-section title="前端工程化" description="构建、规范和发布流程。" marker />
							<view class="demo-sect-body">
								<text class="demo-sect-body__text">默认竖线用 primary，只作区块标记，不表达状态。</text>
							</view>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-sect-block demo-sect-block--last">
							<vx-section title="设计系统" description="令牌、组件和文档。" marker
								marker-color="#7c3aed" />
							<view class="demo-sect-body">
								<text class="demo-sect-body__text">markerColor 是字面值，可以传品牌色；不跟随亮暗主题。</text>
							</view>
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint demo-sect-hint">竖线宽固定 3，高 14 / 16 / 20；和标题首行居中，不跟着说明拉长。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<view class="demo-section__head">
						<view class="demo-section__num">
							<text class="demo-section__num-text">03</text>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-section__copy">
							<text class="demo-section__title">视觉变体</text>
							<text class="demo-section__desc">plain 留在页面底色上；soft 用浅底和 md 圆角分出标题条。</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-sect-stage">
						<view class="demo-sect-block">
							<text class="demo-sect-caption">plain</text>
							<vx-section title="普通区块" description="不加底色、描边和圆角。" />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-sect-block demo-sect-block--last">
							<text class="demo-sect-caption">soft</text>
							<vx-section title="浅底标题条" description="default-soft 底，md 圆角。" variant="soft"
								marker />
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint demo-sect-hint">soft 只用于需要在页面底色上分出标题条的场景；同一个层级不要混用两种。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<view class="demo-section__head">
						<view class="demo-section__num">
							<text class="demo-section__num-text">04</text>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-section__copy">
							<text class="demo-section__title">尺寸</text>
							<text class="demo-section__desc">sm / md / lg 改标题、说明、竖线和留白；md 是默认档。</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-sect-stage">
						<view class="demo-sect-block">
							<text class="demo-sect-caption">sm · 15 / 22</text>
							<vx-section size="sm" title="小号区块" description="适合卡片内部和密集分组。" marker />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-sect-block">
							<text class="demo-sect-caption">md · 17 / 24</text>
							<vx-section title="常规区块" description="页面里最常用的一档。" marker />
						</view>
						<view class="demo-sect-block demo-sect-block--last">
							<text class="demo-sect-caption">lg · 20 / 28</text>
							<vx-section size="lg" title="大号区块" description="用于页面级章节和强标题。" marker />
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint demo-sect-hint">同一层级用同一档；标题栏不是控件，不借 --vx-font-control-*。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<view class="demo-section__head">
						<view class="demo-section__num">
							<text class="demo-section__num-text">05</text>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-section__copy">
							<text class="demo-section__title">插槽</text>
							<text class="demo-section__desc">prefix 放图标，extra 放右侧短操作，suffix 替换说明。</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-sect-stage">
						<view class="demo-sect-block">
							<vx-section clickable title="账户与安全" description="最近 30 天内更新"
								@click="onSectionAction('账户与安全')">
								<template #prefix>
									<vx-icon name="shield" size="md" type="primary" />
								</template>
								<template #extra>
									<view class="demo-sect-action" hover-class="demo-sect-action--pressed"
										@click="onSectionAction('查看全部')">
										<text class="demo-sect-action__text">查看全部</text>
										<vx-icon name="chevron-right" size="sm"
											color="var(--vx-color-primary-pressed)" />
									</view>
								</template>
							</vx-section>
							<view class="demo-sect-body">
								<text class="demo-sect-body__text">prefix 和 extra 都用标题行高托底，小图标和短链接不会顶偏。</text>
							</view>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-sect-block demo-sect-block--last">
							<vx-section title="发布状态" marker>
								<template #suffix>
									<view class="demo-sect-tags">
										<view class="demo-sect-tag">
											<vx-tag size="sm" type="success" variant="soft" text="已发布" />
										</view>
										<view class="demo-sect-tag demo-sect-tag--last">
											<vx-tag size="sm" type="default" variant="soft" text="自动同步" />
										</view>
									</view>
								</template>
							</vx-section>
							<view class="demo-sect-body">
								<text class="demo-sect-body__text">suffix 替换 description，可以放标签、时间或自定义富文本。</text>
							</view>
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint demo-sect-hint">插槽内容不继承标题和说明的字号、颜色；图标、标签和链接自己带样式。标题和右侧「查看全部」各是一次独立点击。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<view class="demo-section__head">
						<view class="demo-section__num">
							<text class="demo-section__num-text">06</text>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-section__copy">
							<text class="demo-section__title">分割线</text>
							<text class="demo-section__desc">divider 在标题内容下方画 1px 线，默认用 border 色。</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-sect-stage">
						<view class="demo-sect-block">
							<vx-section title="版本记录" description="0.31.0 · 2026-10-27" divider />
							<view class="demo-sect-body demo-sect-body--flush">
								<text class="demo-sect-body__text">分割线只分隔当前标题和下文，不代替区块之间的 24。</text>
							</view>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-sect-block demo-sect-block--last">
							<vx-section title="自定义线色" description="dividerColor 是字面值" divider
								divider-color="#cbd5e1" />
							<view class="demo-sect-body demo-sect-body--flush">
								<text class="demo-sect-body__text">默认线色跟主题；需要更浅或更重时再传字面值。</text>
							</view>
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint demo-sect-hint">分割线不压底部留白，也不和卡片外框叠在一起；最后一段不需要分割线时直接关掉。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<view class="demo-section__head">
						<view class="demo-section__num">
							<text class="demo-section__num-text">07</text>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-section__copy">
							<text class="demo-section__title">可点击</text>
							<text class="demo-section__desc">clickable 打开后整条可点，按下变淡并抛 click。</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-sect-stage">
						<view class="demo-sect-block demo-sect-block--last">
							<vx-section clickable title="查看全部订单" description="整条可点，点击更新下面的状态。" marker
								@click="onSectionClick" />
							<text class="demo-sect-status">最近点击：{{ sectionLastAction }}</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint demo-sect-hint">静态标题栏保持默认 clickable=false；需要键盘入口时由外层按钮或链接承载。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-section">
					<view class="demo-section__head">
						<view class="demo-section__num">
							<text class="demo-section__num-text">08</text>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-section__copy">
							<text class="demo-section__title">组合</text>
							<text class="demo-section__desc">文章章节和设置分组：标题栏在前，内容紧跟其后。</text>
						</view>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-sect-stage">
						<view class="demo-sect-block">
							<vx-section title="第一章 · 起点" description="2026 年 10 月 27 日" marker divider />
							<text class="demo-sect-article">标题栏只负责标题层。正文、列表和操作都留在下面，由页面自己排间距和阅读节奏。</text>
						</view>
						<view class="demo-sect-block demo-sect-block--last">
							<vx-section title="账户安全" description="最近 30 天内更新" variant="soft" marker />
							<vx-list-view variant="plain">
								<vx-list-cell title="登录密码" value="已设置" arrow
									@click="onSectionAction('登录密码')">
									<template #prefix>
										<vx-icon name="lock" size="md" type="primary" />
									</template>
								</vx-list-cell>
								<vx-list-cell title="绑定手机" value="138****8888" arrow
									@click="onSectionAction('绑定手机')">
									<template #prefix>
										<vx-icon name="smartphone" size="md" type="info" />
									</template>
								</vx-list-cell>
								<vx-list-cell title="登录设备" value="3 台" arrow :divider="false"
									@click="onSectionAction('登录设备')">
									<template #prefix>
										<vx-icon name="laptop" size="md" type="success" />
									</template>
								</vx-list-cell>
							</vx-list-view>
						</view>
					</view>
					<text class="demo-hint demo-sect-hint">标题栏不包内容，也不加外部间距；页面左右边距用 16，区块之间用 24。</text>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-page-nav">
					<view class="demo-page-nav__item"
						:class="prevPath === '' ? 'demo-page-nav__item--disabled' : ''"
						hover-class="demo-page-nav__item--pressed" @click="goPrev">
						<text class="demo-page-nav__label">上一个</text>
						<text class="demo-page-nav__name">{{ prevName }}</text>
					</view>
					<view class="demo-page-nav__item demo-page-nav__item--next"
						:class="nextPath === '' ? 'demo-page-nav__item--disabled' : ''"
						hover-class="demo-page-nav__item--pressed" @click="goNext">
						<text class="demo-page-nav__label">下一个</text>
						<text class="demo-page-nav__name">{{ nextName }}</text>
					</view>
				</view>

				<view class="demo-footer">
					<text class="demo-footer__text">元汽UI · MIT</text>
					<text class="demo-footer__meta">VAPORIX UI · 组件演示 · v0.59.0</text>
				</view>
			</view>
		</scroll-view>
	</view>
</template>

<script setup>
	import { demoIsDark, syncDemoTheme, toggleDemoPageTheme } from '@/pages/demo/shared/theme'

	// 可点击标题栏和插槽操作共用一份状态，演示最后一步落在哪里。
	const sectionLastAction = ref('还没有点击')

	const onSectionClick = () => {
		sectionLastAction.value = '查看全部订单'
	}

	const onSectionAction = (label: string) => {
		sectionLastAction.value = label
		// 插槽操作和下面的列表行离状态行较远，补一条即时反馈。
		uni.showToast({ title: label, icon: 'none' })
	}

	const isDark = demoIsDark

	const pageClass = computed((): string => {
		return isDark.value ? 'demo-page vx-theme-dark' : 'demo-page vx-theme-light'
	})

	const prevPath: string = '/pages/demo/card/card'
	const nextPath: string = '/pages/demo/white-space/white-space'
	const prevName = '卡片'
	const nextName = '上下留白'

	const goCatalog = () => {
		const pages = getCurrentPages()
		if (pages.length > 1) {
			uni.navigateBack({ delta: 1 })
			return
		}
		uni.switchTab({ url: '/pages/index/index' })
	}

	const goPrev = () => {
		if (prevPath === '') return
		uni.redirectTo({ url: prevPath })
	}

	const goNext = () => {
		if (nextPath === '') return
		uni.redirectTo({ url: nextPath })
	}

	onShow(() => {
		syncDemoTheme()
	})
</script>

<style>
	/* 演示容器只负责竖排和间距；标题栏本身仍然贴页面底色，soft 才能看准。 */
	.demo-sect-stage {
		flex-direction: column;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.demo-sect-block {
		width: 100%;
		margin-bottom: var(--vx-space-lg);
	}

	.demo-sect-block--last {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.demo-sect-caption {
		margin-bottom: var(--vx-space-xs);
		color: var(--vx-color-text-secondary);
		font-size: var(--vx-font-sm);
		line-height: var(--vx-line-sm);
		font-weight: var(--vx-weight-medium);
	}

	/* 示例正文用 surface 描边盒托住，标题栏和内容之间的 8 才看得清。 */
	.demo-sect-body {
		margin-top: var(--vx-space-sm);
		padding-top: var(--vx-space-md);
		padding-right: var(--vx-space-md);
		padding-bottom: var(--vx-space-md);
		padding-left: var(--vx-space-md);
		border-width: var(--vx-border-width);
		border-style: solid;
		border-color: var(--vx-color-border);
		border-radius: var(--vx-radius-md);
		background-color: var(--vx-color-surface);
	}

	.demo-sect-body--flush {
		margin-top: var(--vx-space-md);
	}

	.demo-sect-body__text {
		color: var(--vx-color-text);
		font-size: var(--vx-font-sm);
		line-height: var(--vx-line-sm);
	}

	/* extra 里的「查看全部」自己带 44 热区，不把标题行撑高。 */
	.demo-sect-action {
		flex-direction: row;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-width: 44px;
		min-height: 44px;
		margin-top: -10px;
		margin-right: -8px;
		margin-bottom: -10px;
		padding-left: var(--vx-space-sm);
		padding-right: var(--vx-space-sm);
		border-radius: var(--vx-radius-sm);
	}

	.demo-sect-action--pressed {
		background-color: var(--vx-color-surface-pressed);
	}

	.demo-sect-action__text {
		color: var(--vx-color-primary-pressed);
		font-size: var(--vx-font-sm);
		line-height: var(--vx-line-sm);
		font-weight: var(--vx-weight-medium);
	}

	.demo-sect-tags {
		flex-direction: row;
		align-items: center;
	}

	/* 标签之间留 4；App 不保证 flex gap，用外层盒子的右边距。 */
	.demo-sect-tag {
		margin-right: var(--vx-space-xs);
	}

	.demo-sect-tag--last {
		margin-right: 0;
	}

	.demo-sect-status {
		margin-top: var(--vx-space-sm);
		color: var(--vx-color-text-secondary);
		font-size: var(--vx-font-sm);
		line-height: var(--vx-line-sm);
	}

	.demo-sect-article {
		margin-top: var(--vx-space-sm);
		color: var(--vx-color-text);
		font-size: var(--vx-font-md);
		line-height: var(--vx-line-md);
	}

	.demo-sect-hint {
		margin-top: var(--vx-space-sm);
	}
</style>
